{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":11},"Antonio López: apuntes del natural","Documental sobre el pintor Antonio López y su día a día. Actualmente López trabaja en cuadros sobre las ciudades de Bilbao, Madrid y Sevilla. Algunas de sus obras pertenecen ya a la historia de la pintura. El film muestra el proceso de trabajo de Antonio y expone las situaciones que se producen alrededor. Antonio desprende una cercanía que propicia que la gente se aproxime a él con cariño, pero a la vez ha adquirido una fama similar a la de una estrella de cine, con la que a veces no le resulta fácil convivir.",[4,5,6,7,8,9,10],"artistic creation","rural","urban","education","self-employment","mass media","well-being",{"type":12,"id":13,"slug":14,"title":15,"release":17,"filmType":21,"directors":22,"genre":31,"media":34,"synopsis":37,"production":38,"characters":41,"roles":42,"awards":54,"tags":3},"Film","ES2019_057","es2019-057-antonio-lopez-apuntes-del-natural",{"native":1,"english":16},"",{"type":18,"date":19,"year":20},"Theatrical release","2019-03-01",2019,"Documentary",[23],{"id":24,"slug":25,"name":24,"birthYear":26,"deathYear":27,"gender":28,"nationality":29,"awards":30},"Nicolás Muñoz Avia","nicolas-munoz-avia",1962,0,"Male identifying","Spain",[],[32,33],"Documentary – Observational mode","Documentary – Participatory mode",{"posterUrl":35,"trailerUrl":36},"https://www.filmaffinity.com/es/film184730.html","https://www.filmaffinity.com/es/evideos.php?movie_id=184730",{"native":2,"english":16},[39],{"country":29,"share":40},"Majority coproducer",[],[43,50],{"person":44,"role":49},{"id":45,"slug":46,"name":45,"birthYear":47,"deathYear":27,"gender":28,"nationality":29,"awards":48},"Antonio López","antonio-lopez",1936,[],"Documentary subject",{"person":51,"role":53},{"id":24,"slug":25,"name":24,"birthYear":26,"deathYear":27,"gender":28,"nationality":29,"awards":52},[],"Director of the film",[]],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
